{"id":"a679f616-3315-4dd6-be1d-592e3789eb8f","object":"chat.completion","created":1794481093,"model":"deepseek-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"/>\n<style>\n  html,body{margin:0;padding:0;background:#F5F2E9;}\n  *{box-sizing:border-box;}\n  :root{\n    --bg:#F5F2E9;--surface:#F3F0E7;--ink:#1B2620;--muted:#5C665D;\n    --green:#4F5E43;--gold:#B4914A;--blue:#8C9FB2;--line:#A3AC9E;\n  }\n  .slide{\n    position:relative;width:1920px;height:1080px;overflow:hidden;background:#F5F2E9;\n    font-family:\"PingFang SC\",\"Hiragino Sans GB\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",\"Helvetica Neue\",Arial,sans-serif;\n    color:var(--ink);-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;\n  }\n  /* ---------- background field ---------- */\n  .bg{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:0;\n    background:\n      radial-gradient(1100px 780px at 2% 0%,rgba(180,145,74,.10),transparent 70%),\n      radial-gradient(880px 760px at 47% 46%,rgba(140,159,178,.10),transparent 70%),\n      radial-gradient(950px 760px at 95% 95%,rgba(79,94,67,.10),transparent 72%),\n      linear-gradient(168deg,#F8F5EC 0%,#F5F2E9 52%,#EFECE1 100%);}\n  .bg:after{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;\n    background:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(27,38,32,.042) 0 1px,transparent 1px 160px);}\n  .dots{position:absolute;z-index:1;right:70px;top:120px;width:430px;height:150px;opacity:.30;\n    background-image:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(27,38,32,.45) 1.05px,transparent 1.15px);\n    background-size:15px 15px;}\n  .gl{position:absolute;z-index:1;top:0;width:1px;height:1080px;background:rgba(27,38,32,.05);}\n  .gl1{left:480px;}.gl2{left:960px;}.gl3{left:1440px;}\n  .register{position:absolute;z-index:1;right:-140px;top:-170px;width:400px;height:400px;border-radius:50%;\n    border:1px solid rgba(27,38,32,.16);}\n  .register .r2{position:absolute;inset:26px;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid rgba(27,38,32,.10);}\n  .register .r3{position:absolute;inset:58px;border-radius:50%;\n    background:conic-gradient(from 210deg,rgba(79,94,67,.10),rgba(79,94,67,0) 26%,rgba(140,159,178,.16) 52%,rgba(140,159,178,.04) 78%,rgba(79,94,67,.10));}\n  .register .dot{position:absolute;left:96px;top:262px;width:11px;height:11px;border-radius:50%;\n    background:var(--gold);box-shadow:0 0 0 5px rgba(180,145,74,.12);}\n\n  .top-rule{position:absolute;z-index:6;left:96px;top:110px;width:1728px;height:1px;background:rgba(27,38,32,.30);}\n\n  /* ---------- header ---------- */\n  .meta{position:absolute;z-index:8;left:96px;top:62px;width:1728px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;}\n  .meta-left{font-size:15px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:4px;color:#4F5B53;}\n  .meta-right{font-size:14px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:2.6px;color:#78817A;}\n\n  .head{position:absolute;z-index:8;left:96px;top:158px;width:1300px;}\n  .kicker{display:flex;align-items:center;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:4.4px;color:#6A756B;}\n  .kicker .k-line{display:inline-block;width:38px;height:2px;background:var(--gold);margin-right:16px;}\n  .title{\n    margin:22px 0 0 0;font-size:78px;line-height:1.14;letter-spacing:3px;font-weight:700;\n    font-family:\"Songti SC\",\"Source Han Serif SC\",\"Noto Serif CJK SC\",Georgia,serif;\n    color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ink) 92%,black);\n  }\n  .lede{margin:22px 0 0 0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:1px;color:var(--muted);}\n\n  /* ---------- cards ---------- */\n  .cards{position:absolute;z-index:9;left:96px;top:396px;width:1728px;display:flex;gap:32px;}\n  .card{position:relative;flex:1 1 0;height:512px;padding:32px 30px 28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;\n    background:rgba(243,240,231,.74);border:1px solid rgba(27,38,32,.14);}\n  .card:before{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:-1px;top:-1px;width:calc(100% + 2px);height:4px;background:var(--c);}\n  .c1{--c:#4F5E43;}\n  .c2{--c:#B4914A;}\n  .c3{--c:#8C9FB2;}\n  .c4{--c:#A3AC9E;background:rgba(243,240,231,.46);border:1px dashed rgba(27,38,32,.28);}\n\n  .c-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;}\n  .c-no{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:3.2px;color:var(--c);}\n  .c-en{font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:2.6px;color:#8A938B;}\n  .c-label{margin-top:14px;font-size:36px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:6px;color:#222D26;}\n  .c-rule{height:1px;background:rgba(27,38,32,.16);margin:20px 0 24px;}\n\n  .c-body{flex:1 1 auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-height:0;}\n  .c-note{margin-top:auto;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid rgba(27,38,32,.10);\n    font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:.4px;color:#727C74;}\n\n  /* stats */\n  .stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:26px 16px;}\n  .num{font-family:\"Songti SC\",\"Source Han Serif SC\",Georgia,serif;font-size:46px;line-height:1;\n    font-weight:700;color:#3C4A34;letter-spacing:1px;}\n  .num .unit{font-family:inherit;font-size:17px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:1px;margin-left:5px;color:#5C665D;}\n  .lab{margin-top:9px;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:1.2px;color:var(--muted);}\n\n  /* lists */\n  .list{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;}\n  .list li{position:relative;padding-left:22px;font-size:22px;line-height:1.85;letter-spacing:1px;color:#26312A;}\n  .list li:before{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:0;top:15px;width:7px;height:7px;background:var(--c);}\n  .list.dim li{color:#5A645C;}\n  .list.dim li:before{background:#A3AC9E;}\n\n  .sub{margin:0 0 12px 0;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:3.4px;color:#6A756B;}\n  .sub.gap{margin-top:26px;}\n\n  .chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:9px;}\n  .chips span{display:inline-block;padding:7px 13px;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:1px;color:#6B5423;\n    background:rgba(180,145,74,.12);border:1px solid rgba(180,145,74,.46);}\n\n  /* ---------- footer ---------- */\n  .foot{position:absolute;z-index:10;left:96px;top:932px;width:1728px;display:flex;\n    justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;border-top:1px solid rgba(27,38,32,.18);padding-top:22px;}\n  .foot-note{font-size:15px;letter-spacing:1.2px;color:#77817A;}\n  .pageno{font-size:18px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:4px;color:#4F5E43;}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"slide\">\n  <div class=\"bg\"></div>\n  <div class=\"dots\"></div>\n  <div class=\"gl gl1\"></div>\n  <div class=\"gl gl2\"></div>\n  <div class=\"gl gl3\"></div>\n  <div class=\"register\"><span class=\"r2\"></span><span class=\"r3\"></span><span class=\"dot\"></span></div>\n\n  <div class=\"top-rule\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"meta\">\n    <div class=\"meta-left\">澄图工单云 · 产品介绍</div>\n    <div class=\"meta-right\">虚构测评材料 · 数值为构造值</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"head\">\n    <div class=\"kicker\"><span class=\"k-line\"></span>06 / 信息边界</div>\n    <h1 class=\"title\">事实边界与未确定事项</h1>\n    <p class=\"lede\">已完成、已明确、未确定、无依据：四类信息分栏陈述，不作越界推断。</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"cards\">\n\n    <section class=\"card c1\">\n      <div class=\"c-top\"><span class=\"c-no\">01</span><span class=\"c-en\">COMPLETED</span></div>\n      <div class=\"c-label\">已完成</div>\n      <div class=\"c-rule\"></div>\n      <div class=\"c-body\">\n        <div class=\"stats\">\n          <div class=\"stat\">\n            <div class=\"num\">17<span class=\"unit\">支</span></div>\n            <div class=\"lab\">试点团队</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"stat\">\n            <div class=\"num\">426<span class=\"unit\">张</span></div>\n            <div class=\"lab\">试点工单</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"stat\">\n            <div class=\"num\">19<span class=\"unit\">分钟</span></div>\n            <div class=\"lab\">平均响应时长</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"stat\">\n            <div class=\"num\">3<span class=\"unit\">小时</span></div>\n            <div class=\"lab\">培训时长</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"c-note\">以上均为测评构造值，不代表真实经营效果。</div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"card c2\">\n      <div class=\"c-top\"><span class=\"c-no\">02</span><span class=\"c-en\">DEFINED</span></div>\n      <div class=\"c-label\">已明确</div>\n      <div class=\"c-rule\"></div>\n      <div class=\"c-body\">\n        <div class=\"sub\">三项功能</div>\n        <ul class=\"list\">\n          <li>工单归类</li>\n          <li>责任人分派</li>\n          <li>状态追踪</li>\n        </ul>\n        <div class=\"sub gap\">四步实施路径</div>\n        <div class=\"chips\">\n          <span>资料梳理</span>\n          <span>流程映射</span>\n          <span>小组试用</span>\n          <span>复盘</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"c-note\">功能范围与实施路径已在资料中列明。</div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"card c3\">\n      <div class=\"c-top\"><span class=\"c-no\">03</span><span class=\"c-en\">UNDETERMINED</span></div>\n      <div class=\"c-label\">未确定</div>\n      <div class=\"c-rule\"></div>\n      <div class=\"c-body\">\n        <ul class=\"list\">\n          <li>实施排期</li>\n          <li>预算</li>\n          <li>责任人分工</li>\n          <li>验收指标</li>\n        </ul>\n        <div class=\"c-note\">资料未给出上述内容，均属未确定，不作补写。</div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"card c4\">\n      <div class=\"c-top\"><span class=\"c-no\">04</span><span class=\"c-en\">NO BASIS</span></div>\n      <div class=\"c-label\">无依据</div>\n      <div class=\"c-rule\"></div>\n      <div class=\"c-body\">\n        <ul class=\"list dim\">\n          <li>营收</li>\n          <li>市场份额</li>\n          <li>认证信息</li>\n        </ul>\n        <div class=\"c-note\">资料未提供依据，本材料不作陈述。</div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"foot\">\n    <div class=\"foot-note\">资料性质：虚构测评材料，数值为测评构造值，不代表真实经营效果。</div>\n    <div class=\"pageno\">6 / 6</div>\n  </div>\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>","reasoning_content":"Let me create a clean, elegant HTML slide following the reference style: warm paper background #F5F2E9, ink #1B2620, accent green #4F5E43, gold #B4914A, blue-grey #8C9FB2, serif display + sans body (no external fonts — use system serif/sans).\n\nPage 6: 事实边界与未确定事项. Four status columns: 已完成 / 已明确 / 未确定 / 无依据.\n\nLayout: 1920×1080. Top meta, title, four cards in a row with status labels. Page number bottom right \"6 / 6\".\n\nLet me build carefully.\n\nStructure:\n- .bg-field, dot-field, gridlines, top-rule, left-rule\n- header: 序号 \"06\" / meta \"澄图工单云 · 产品介绍\"\n- Title 「事实边界与未确定事项」, subtitle\n- Four columns cards: each with a status chip (编号 01-04), a label, bullets.\n- Footer note: 资料性质：虚构测评材料。\n\nContent:\n1. 已完成 — 试点覆盖 17 支团队、426 张工单，平均响应 19 分钟，培训 3 小时（测评构造值）\n2. 已明确 — 三项功能（工单归类、责任人分派、状态追踪）与四步实施路径（资料梳理、流程映射、小组试用、复盘）\n3. 未确定 — 实施排期、预算、责任人分工、验收指标\n4. 无依据 — 营收、市场份额、认证信息，本材料不作陈述\n\nDesign: 4 cards with different accent colors? Keep to primary green for 已完成, secondary gold for 已明确, tertiary blue for 未确定, muted/line for 无依据 (dashed border, hollow).\n\nLet's write CSS.\n\nCard width: total content 1760 (96 margins). gap 32 → 4 cards: (1760 - 3*32)/4 = (1760-96)/4 = 416. Good.\n\nCard height ~ 500px. Title area top.\n\nVertical layout:\n- top-rule at y=48\n- meta at y=61\n- title at ~ y=150, font-size 88px serif\n- subtitle y ~ 290\n- cards y=380 to 880\n- footnote y=930\n- page number bottom right\n\nLet me write the HTML.\n\nFor the display font, use serif: 'Songti SC', 'Source Han Serif SC', Georgia, serif. Body: 'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif.\n\nCareful with font-size for Chinese.\n\nLet me write:\n\n```html\n<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"/>\n<style>\nhtml,body{margin:0;padding:0;background:#F5F2E9;}\n*{box-sizing:border-box;}\n:root{...}\n.slide{position:relative;width:1920px;height:1080px;overflow:hidden;background:...;}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"slide\">\n...\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>\n```\n\nNote the instruction: only styles in <style>, no external. Fine.\n\nLet's detail the visual:\n\nBackground layers:\n.bg-field absolute inset 0 with radial gradients.\n.gridline vertical lines at 480/960/1440 — actually for this page, maybe subtle.\n.dot field top-right.\n.register circle top-right? The reference has decorative circle. I'll add a subtle one but keep it from clashing with title. Title is on the left; circle at right top is fine.\n\nHeader:\n- .page-mark \"06\" at left 96, top 61? Reference had page-no left. I'll do: left \"06 — 事实边界\" small caps meta. Actually let's do: top-left small label \"澄图工单云 · 产品介绍\", top-right \"06 / 06\"? No, page number must be bottom right. So top-right can be \"资料性质：虚构测评材料\".\n\nHeader line: top-rule horizontal at 96..1824, y=110.\n\nTitle at y ~ 190: \"事实边界与未确定事项\" — 76px serif bold. Subtitle below: \"已完成、已明确、未确定、无依据 —— 四类信息分栏陈述，界限清晰\".\n\nCards start y=400.\n\nCard design:\n- top thin rule with accent color, width full of card\n- number \"01\" small mono-ish\n- label big: 已完成 / 已明确 / 未确定 / 无依据\n- English-ish? no. keep Chinese.\n- bullets with small square markers.\n\nCard content font sizes: label 40px, body 22px, line-height 1.9.\n\nCard 1 body:\n- 试点覆盖 17 支团队\n- 426 张工单纳入试点\n- 平均响应 19 分钟\n- 培训 3 小时\n- 以上均为测评构造值\n\nCard 2:\n- 三项功能：工单归类、责任人分派、状态追踪\n- 四步实施路径：资料梳理、流程映射、小组试用、复盘\n\nCard 3:\n- 实施排期\n- 预算\n- 责任人分工\n- 验收指标\n（资料均未给出，属未确定）\n\nCard 4:\n- 营收\n- 市场份额\n- 认证信息\n（本材料不作陈述）\n\nFooter: left small note \"数据来源：虚构测评材料，构造值不代表真实经营效果\"; right \"6 / 6\".\n\nBottom-left maybe a rule.\n\nNow the \"已完成\" card items — use a stat style: number + unit. Let's make card 1 have stat rows: 17 支 / 426 张 / 19 分钟 / 3 小时. That's nicer. But card height equal. Let me make card 1 with mini stats grid 2×2: each with big number and label.\n\nCard 1: 2x2 grid:\n- 17 支  试点团队\n- 426 张  试点工单\n- 19 分钟  平均响应时长\n- 3 小时  培训时长\nPlus footnote \"测评构造值\".\n\nThat's a nice differentiated layout. Card width 416 — grid 2 columns of ~180 each, number font 44px, label 16px. Works.\n\nOthers: list of items with markers.\n\nCard 2: 5 items? 三项功能 + 四步实施路径. Structure:\n\"三项功能\" subsection: 工单归类 / 责任人分派 / 状态追踪\n\"四步实施路径\" subsec